{"id": "1485669586606231665", "channel_id": "1300659802455674972", "author_id": "869942522431045733", "author_name": "ice8495", "content": "<@1372028651175936080>  How about Damage output calculation formula", "timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:00:31.853000+00:00", "mentions": ["1372028651175936080"]}
{"id": "1485669622589161512", "channel_id": "1300659802455674972", "author_id": "1372028651175936080", "author_name": "Morimens", "content": "**Damage output formula (best‑known approximation)**  \n\n```\nDamage = (ATK + (Secondary Stat)) \n         × Weapon Multiplier \n         × (1 + Crit DMG %) \n         × Level‑Diff Mod \n         × (1 + any Skill/Exalt bonuses)\n```\n\n**What each term means**\n\n| Term | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| **ATK** | Your character’s base Attack stat. |\n| **Secondary Stat** | Usually DEF or a character‑specific stat that adds to damage (e.g., Tentacle DMG for Miryam). |\n| **Weapon Multiplier** | The % damage shown on the card/skill (e.g., *45 % ATK* for *Exalted Pyre*). |\n| **Crit DMG %** | Critical damage bonus (e.g., 200 % CDMG = 2.0). |\n| **Level‑Diff Mod** | A scaling factor based on the level difference between you and the enemy (positive if you’re higher, negative if lower). |\n| **Skill/Exalt bonuses** | Any additional multipliers from Exalts, Wheels, Talents, etc. (e.g., “Ritual: Final DMG + 250 %”). |\n\n### How to use it\n1. **Take the skill’s base %** (e.g., *Strike* = 10 % ATK at rank 1).  \n2. **Add any flat stat bonuses** (e.g., +5 % ATK from a Wheel).  \n3. **Multiply by your ATK + secondary stat**.  \n4. **Apply crit multiplier** if the hit can crit.  \n5. **Adjust for level difference** (the game applies a hidden modifier; the exact numbers aren’t public).  \n6. **Add any extra multipliers** from Exalts, Wheels, Talents, etc.\n\n### Caveats\n- The exact **Level‑Diff Mod** and the precise way secondary stats stack are not publicly documented; the above is the community‑derived approximation.  \n- Some characters have unique damage sources (e.g., **Tentacle DMG**, **Aliemus generation**) that are added on top of the base formula.  \n- Official updates (patch notes, Discord announcements) can tweak individual skill numbers, so always double‑check the latest data on the **Morimens Discord** (`#updates` or `#damage‑info` channels).\n\n**Bottom line:** Damage ≈ (ATK + secondary) × skill % × (1 + crit %) × level‑diff × extra mods. Use the current skill percentages and any active", "timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:00:40.432000+00:00", "type": 19, "author_bot": true, "mentions": ["869942522431045733"], "reply_to": "1485669586606231665"}
