{"id": "1485670466562687046", "channel_id": "1300659802455674972", "author_id": "1372028651175936080", "author_name": "Morimens", "content": "**Yuri ships that are currently popular in Morimens (per community discussion):**\n\n- **N / Ryker** – the most frequently mentioned pairing.  \n- **Thais / Alva** – a solid second‑choice ship.  \n- **Lotan / Helot** – also gets a fair amount of fan support.\n\nThese three are the ones that show up most often in Reddit threads and Discord chatter. Ship preferences are subjective, so you might find other pairings that suit your taste.\n\n*For the latest consensus, hop into the official Morimens Discord:* `https://discord.com/invite/VJhuUdHxmc`.", "timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:04:01.651000+00:00", "type": 19, "author_bot": true, "mentions": ["324179498256039936"], "reply_to": "1485670427375308850"}
