{"id": "1485671550618177659", "channel_id": "1300659802455674972", "author_id": "1372028651175936080", "author_name": "Morimens", "content": "**Answer:**  \nI wasn’t able to locate a definitive “best Thai Morimens content creator.” The available sources (Kaiden.gg, r/Morimens, general Thai influencer lists) don’t single out anyone who focuses specifically on Morimens in Thai.\n\n**What you can do next**\n\n1. **Official channels** – Check the Morimens Discord (especially <#1180845276823564288>) or the game’s official social media for any creator spotlights.  \n2. **Community ask‑around** – Post in the Morimens Discord or the r/Morimens subreddit asking Thai players for their go‑to creators.  \n3. **Thai gaming forums** – Look at Thai gaming communities (e.g., Thai Discord servers, Facebook groups) and search for “Morimens” to see who’s posting guides or streams.\n\nIf you find a creator that consistently posts high‑quality Thai guides, that’s likely your best bet. Until then, the community is the most reliable source.", "timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:08:20.110000+00:00", "type": 19, "author_bot": true, "mentions": ["324179498256039936"], "reply_to": "1485671487666131168"}
